//! Golden frames of the retime scenarios, produced by `gen_goldens.py` (next to this file): an
//! independent numpy float32 model of the premultiply, blend and unpremultiply steps. Wire pixels
//! are `[r, g, b, a]`. `F*` is the input clip, `R*` the engine's premultiply / unpremultiply round
//! trip of `F*`, `B01` the blend of the premultiplied frames 0 and 1 with weight 0.5 (then
//! unpremultiplied), `B3T` the blend of frame 3 with a transparent frame, `B01_25` and `B01_75` the
//! weights 0.25 and 0.75. Do not edit by hand: rerun `python gen_goldens.py goldens.rs`.

